  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Manufatura Avan\xE7ada 4.0"
  _titleEn: Advanced Manufacturing 4.0
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Na Ind\xFAstria 4.0, m\xE1quinas conectadas trocam dados e se ajustam
    sozinhas, produzindo mais com menos desperd\xEDcio."
  _summaryEn: In Industry 4.0, connected machines exchange data and adjust themselves,
    producing more with less waste.
  _realWorld: "O termo Industrie 4.0 surgiu na Alemanha, apresentado na feira de
    Hannover em 2011, como estrat\xE9gia industrial do pa\xEDs."
  _realWorldEn: The term Industrie 4.0 emerged in Germany, presented at the Hannover
    fair in 2011 as the country's industrial strategy.
  _tradeOffs: "Exige investimento alto, reduz vagas de baixa qualifica\xE7\xE3o e
    aumenta o risco de ataques cibern\xE9ticos \xE0s f\xE1bricas."
  _tradeOffsEn: It requires heavy investment, cuts low-skill jobs and increases the
    risk of cyberattacks on factories.
  _sources:
  - Label: Fourth Industrial Revolution (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fourth_Industrial_Revolution
